{
  "name": "Spout Spores",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/hands-cloud-light-pink.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to spurt a cloud of spores at a target within Very Close range:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Energizing Spores.</strong> The target clears a HP and immediately takes the spotlight. It has advantage on its next attack.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hallucinogenic Spores.</strong> The target must succeed on an Instinct Reaction Roll (13) or mark a Stress and become <em>Dizzied</em>. <em>Dizzied</em> targets have disadvantage on their next action roll, then clear the condition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reanimating Spores.</strong> A corpse rises as a @UUID[Compendium.undead-adversaries-for-daggerheart.undead-adversaries.Actor.VbhRMtfkee9tbtms]{Spore Zombie}</p></li></ul>",
